{"meta":{"id":"code-style","category":"it/server/frontend/ui-style","title":"코드 출력 스타일","subtitle":"","summary":"react-syntax-highlighter 코드 출력 스타일 정리","tags":["react","syntax highlighter","코드 스타일"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"blog: code/front/CodeStyleList.jsx","updatedAt":"2024-11-06"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>REACT</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2024-11-06</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">코드 출력 스타일</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> react-syntax-highlighter 코드 출력 스타일 정리</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">인스톨 필요</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">npm i react-syntax-highlighter</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Code Viewer</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">사용 가능한 스타일 (prism)</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">twilight</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">darcula</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">solarizedlight</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">vs</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">coy</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">funky</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">okaidia</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">tomorrow</span><span class=\"inline-flex px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 text-[12px] font-semibold text-cyan-700\">xonokai</span></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">블로그에서는 스타일을 골라가며 같은 코드를 비교해 볼 수 있게 구성했습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">사용법</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsx</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import { Prism as SyntaxHighlighter } from &#x27;react-syntax-highlighter&#x27;;\r\nimport { darcula, coy, funky, okaidia, solarizedlight, tomorrow, twilight, vs, xonokai }\r\n  from &#x27;react-syntax-highlighter/dist/esm/styles/prism&#x27;;\r\n\r\n&lt;SyntaxHighlighter language=&quot;javascript&quot; style={twilight}&gt;\r\n  {code}\r\n&lt;/SyntaxHighlighter&gt;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">비교용 예시 코드</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import React from &#x27;react&#x27;;\r\n\r\nfunction Example() {\r\n    return &lt;h1&gt;Hello, World!&lt;/h1&gt;;\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport default Example;</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/frontend/ui-style/code-style","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"frontend","title":"프론트엔드","path":"it/server/frontend"},{"id":"ui-style","title":"UI · 스타일","path":"it/server/frontend/ui-style"}],"hasImage":false}